            "description": {
              "content": "This API operation retrieves the details of a specific pipeline schedule for a Bitbucket repository. By providing the workspace identifier, repository slug, and the unique UUID of the schedule, you can fetch information about an automated pipeline execution schedule, including its configuration, timing settings, enabled status, and associated branch or target. This endpoint is useful for reviewing existing pipeline automation settings and understanding when and how pipelines are configured to run automatically within a specific repository.",
